[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
Also: Neocities[% dots %] will actually be the first to be updated,
because I decided that instead of trying to make a big
message, I would just[% dots %] make something.  I thought of this
when I was walking home tonight, that the best way of showing
the Web I want to see is to just make it, and its existence
alone would serve to defy everything that it is different
from: I like text files, not Word and PowerPoint and Excel.
I like old and modest tech, not the newest buzzword AI tech.
I like the 90s Web, the Open Web, not the corporate Web,
where a few monopolies control all our data, creations,
and livelihoods; where people are spoon-fed content made
just for the sake of content, not for the love of making;
and where people are compressed into canned descriptions
of their lives, to be copied over and over in those perfect
rectangular profile boxes, so much so that [%# space #%]
[%- BLOCK link -%]<a href="https://abdullahtarawneh.com/blog/personal-websites/">[% content %]</a>[% END -%]
[% IF html -%]
[% WRAPPER link %]they themselves start to introduce their being as such[% END %]
[%- ELSE -%]
[% WRAPPER link %]they themselves[% END %]
[% WRAPPER link %]start to introduce their being as such[% END %]
[%- END %][% dots %]
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

